# Project Structure

## Package Layout
- All source code lives in `src/model_router_toolkit/`
- Use `src/` layout for proper packaging (setuptools finds packages in `src/`)
- Tests live in `tests/` at project root, NOT inside `src/`
- Config files in `configs/`, notebooks in `notebooks/`, docs in `docs/`

## Naming Conventions
- Python files: snake_case
- Classes: PascalCase
- All router implementations go in their method subpackage: `kmeans/`, `prefill/`
- Server endpoints go in `server/`

## Import Rules
- Public API imports from `model_router_toolkit` (the __init__.py)
- Internal imports use full paths: `from model_router_toolkit.kmeans.router import KMeansRouter`
- Never import from `kmeans/` or `prefill/` directly in user-facing code — use the config-driven factory
